  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.34 “Intermediate cover” means the material placed over waste at a landfill prior to constructing a cap. The term does not include “daily cover.”\n\nSource. #14103, eff 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
